  "title": "Field optimization tools for field schemes",
  "product": "Jira platform",
  "status": "rolling_out",
  "description": "Jira Cloud admins can now access streamlining tools from the field schemes experience in Jira admin settings. These tools optimize field schemes by removing unused fields, creating project-specific schemes, splitting schemes, and provide functionality to download optimization details. To get started with this change: From the top navigation, go to Settings, then Work items.\n\tSelect Field schemes.\n\tSelect the field scheme you want to manage.\n\tUnder Actions, select Optimize to use the streamlining",
